## Development

See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for the rules, the skills (procedures) and the documentation index.


### Prerequisites

- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) ≥ 0.5
- [just](https://just.systems/) (task runner)
{%- if platform == 'github' %}
- [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) ≥ 2.105 (issues, PRs, releases through `just`)
{%- else %}
- [forgejo-cli](https://codeberg.org/forgejo-contrib/forgejo-cli) (`fj`) 0.7 (issues, PRs, releases through `just`)
{%- endif %}
- Python {{ python_version }} (managed by uv via `.python-version`)

`.copier/setup.sh` installs all of these on a clean Linux machine; `just doctor` checks an existing setup.

### Common commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `just fix` | Auto-format and fix imports (run before committing) |
| `just lint` | Ruff + pyright only (fast feedback, no tests) |
| `just check` | Full CI suite: format-check + lint + typecheck + tests |
| `just --list` | Show all available recipes |


Issues, PRs and releases are also handled through `just` recipes (`just issues`, `just pr`, `just release`, …) — see [docs/workflow.md](docs/workflow.md).
